# Patch files must stay LF + BOM-free so `git apply` works on Linux CI (CLAUDE.md §7 fork patches).
# 保留 unified diff 的空白上下文前缀，不将其当作源码行尾空白。
*.patch text eol=lf whitespace=-space-before-tab,-blank-at-eol

# Python sources stay LF so whole-file CRLF flips never pollute diffs again.
*.py text eol=lf

# 生成暗金文件按导出字节绑定语料/图来源，跨平台检出不得自动转换换行。
data/physical_graph/uniques/generated_uniques.lua -text whitespace=cr-at-eol

# README 构筑样例保留原始导出字节，避免换行转换改变文件。
examples/Deadeye_Ice_Shot_99.* -text whitespace=cr-at-eol,-blank-at-eol
